[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2717.91, "timestamp": "00:45:17", "text": "哇。嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。来自您的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2721.349, "timestamp": "00:45:21", "text": "风格。你在看什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2724.15, "timestamp": "00:45:24", "text": "看看。看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2726.51, "timestamp": "00:45:26", "text": "有一个箱子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2734.43, "timestamp": "00:45:34", "text": "他们真的很不喜欢陌生人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2739.67, "timestamp": "00:45:39", "text": "嗯？第六个垃圾袋。来自法国"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2741.829, "timestamp": "00:45:41", "text": "弗兰基亚。我们不被允许这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2744.47, "timestamp": "00:45:44", "text": "一。这辆车会让我们被告上法庭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2750.589, "timestamp": "00:45:50", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2753.829, "timestamp": "00:45:53", "text": "不，我的天哪，我打哈欠好多。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2756.79, "timestamp": "00:45:56", "text": "它甚至都不完全属于这个系列，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2759.27, "timestamp": "00:45:59", "text": "但我们忘记修改了。是的。"}]